29
#   block a coordinating seat from editing a README, a workflow, or a config.
30
#
31
# ------------------------------ SEAT RESOLUTION -----------------------------
32
# Resolved in this order; the first hit wins:
33
#
34
#   1. $FATHOMDB_SEAT   — the escape hatch, and the ONLY channel a main-thread
35
